cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Zemanium open geothermal research: guides, simulation records and a power-cost model"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
type: dataset
url: "https://zemanium.com/open/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tonizemani2/zemanium-open"
authors:
  - family-names: Zemani
    given-names: Toni
abstract: >-
  Sourced guides to geothermal electricity cost, enhanced geothermal systems
  and superhot rock; eight simulation records in JSON; and a browser model of
  the levelized cost of electricity of a geothermal plant across 1,080
  scenarios. All model output is labelled SIMULATED.
keywords:
  - geothermal
  - enhanced geothermal systems
  - superhot rock
  - levelized cost of electricity
  - well integrity
